  "evidencia": "Page: 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour. Sentence: The 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour was an endurance race for a variety of GT and touring car classes, including: GT3 cars, GT4 cars, Group 3E Series Production Cars and Dubai 24 Hour cars.\nPage: 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour. Sentence: The event, which was staged at the Mount Panorama Circuit, near Bathurst, in New South Wales, Australia on 10 February 2013, was the eleventh running of the Bathurst 12 Hour.\nPage: Mount Panorama Circuit. Sentence: Mount Panorama Circuit is a motor racing track located in Bathurst, New South Wales, Australia.\nPage: Mount Panorama Circuit. Sentence: The 6.213 km long track is technically a street circuit, and is a public road, with normal speed restrictions, when no racing events are being run, and there are many residences which can only be accessed from the circuit.",
