        "original_id": "9f6d8171-500a-5dd5-a889-e3b02ebc348a",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Events: 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour\n- Places: Mount Panorama Circuit, Bathurst, New South Wales, Australia\n- Topics: endurance racing, GT and touring car classes\n\nFacts:\n- The 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour was held on 10 February 2013.\n- The 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour was the eleventh running of the Bathurst 12 Hour.\n- The 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour was an endurance race for GT and touring car classes including GT3, GT4, Group 3E Series Production Cars, and Dubai 24 Hour cars.\n- The 2013 Liqui Moly Bathurst 12 Hour was staged at Mount Panorama Circuit near Bathurst in New South Wales, Australia.\n- Mount Panorama Circuit is a 6.213 km motor racing track in Bathurst, New South Wales, Australia.\n- Mount Panorama Circuit is technically a street circuit and a public road with normal speed restrictions when races are not being run.\n- Mount Panorama Circuit has many residences that can only be accessed from the circuit.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
